WEBVTT

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:17.990
December 4, 771, New Holy Era

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.690
Here we go!

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:32.730
The tide of the war is turning to our favor.

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:37.100
Your wish to reclaim the throne
is about to be fulfilled.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:44.190
It hasn't come true yet.
I still have a mission that I must carry out--

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:47.310
to put down the pope, rescue Charlot,

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:52.900
and make sure that the relic
doesn't fall into anyone else's hands.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:58.730
I cannot do any of these things alone. However,

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:05.100
I have all of you, as well.
Encouraging friends who are helping me.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.560
Those who want there to be peace.
Those who want to live in tranquility.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:13.560
I will take their wishes,
their desires, their hopes...

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:15.520
...and unite them as one!

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:24.400
So, you have finally made it this far.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:31.850
Even if I were to fall,
I know that you will surely...

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:39.150
I can die without regrets now.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:20.770
Maurice!

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.900
You're starting to lose your edge, Maurice.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.850
Old Man Balthauser!

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:35.360
Imagine, you, losing a step
against youngsters such as these.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:35.690
"Royal Order Squad 2 Commander"
"Balthauser Dreadnought"

00:03:41.310 --> 00:03:43.850
Princess Marielle!

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:48.440
I, Balthauser, have arrived, albeit a bit late.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:51.020
Balthauser! Thank goodness you're all right!

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:53.350
We feared that Flegel had done away with you.

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:57.100
Nonsense! Who do you think I am?

00:03:57.100 --> 00:04:00.440
They may try striking at me from
the shadows or knocking me over a cliff,

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.980
but I will not die!

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:08.230
Leave it to you, old man.
They don't call you the immortal hero for nothing.

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:10.650
Hero? More like monster.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:14.230
All right, Balthauser, we would like you
to return to your previous squad,

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:16.400
and take command of it.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:17.810
Before I do...

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:26.310
Princess Marielle,
despite my remaining in the capital,

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:28.770
I was unable to put a stop
to Vall d'Hebron's ambitions,

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:32.810
nor could I keep King Charlot safe.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:35.440
Also, that whole incident
with my grandson, Flegel,

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:38.560
only came about because of my ineffectualness.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:41.060
How can I apologize to you?

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:43.730
Oh, no.
The tragedy that has befallen this nation

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.690
began as a result of my father's twisted wishes.

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:52.730
That is why I must put a stop to it.
As princess of the Hortensia family.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:58.560
You have grown up to be a fine young lady,
Princess Marielle.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.230
Let's fight together.

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:06.190
You are going, then?

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:09.560
You stay behind. You're in command now.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:12.900
And if I were to say no?

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:15.980
You are the only one who can fill my stead.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:23.150
We're up, you two.

00:05:23.150 --> 00:05:25.600
It took long enough.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.980
This time, we'll get to do a lot of killing, right?

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:32.230
The advance force has been divided?

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:36.480
They're planning to lure us in
and then pick us off a unit at a time.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.270
It's a tactic they couldn't pull off
without good leadership.

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.020
Maurice?

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:45.940
A fighting style that makes sport of
the enemy by coordinating one's soldiers--

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.690
There's one person who is very skilled at that.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:51.230
Continue to divert them and create disorder!

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:53.270
On the dignity of the Ecclesiastical Order,

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:56.060
hold back the rebel army,
no matter what it takes!

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:58.770
Why is Captain Georg fighting against us?

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.730
He's your old pal, isn't he, Pops?

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:03.520
Friendship and conviction
are two separate things.

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:05.350
I'll take on Georg.

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:07.770
B-But Maurice...!

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:11.810
I know better than anyone how he operates.

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:13.810
I'm the one who has to do this.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:20.810
The rebel army is through the main capital gate,

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:24.350
and appears to have made
its way onto the city's streets.

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:28.770
The Ecclesiastical Knights have been
unexpectedly faint-hearted.

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:33.440
Even with Captain Georg in command,
I believe it is only a matter of time.

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:36.060
I'm afraid this will not do.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:39.230
The ritual is not yet complete.

00:06:39.230 --> 00:06:42.480
Didier, go and lend them your assistance.

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.480
As you wish.

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:55.650
We'll go and rescue the forces
that have been isolated.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:56.770
See to that.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:58.480
Let's go, Deflotte!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.100
Yeah!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.100
Reinforcements?!

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.350
All forces, attack!

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.310
I'm going to go assist the advance force.

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:12.030
Ma'am!

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.560
Adelheid!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.150
Princess Marielle?

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:17.350
Please take me with you.

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:20.690
But Your Highness, if anything
were to happen to you...

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.690
I have a bad feeling that
something is going to happen.

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:32.230
It looks like the entire
Olivier army is charging in!

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:36.270
Pull the front line back!
Bring the advance guard within the castle walls!

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:41.020
To the immaculate light!

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.440
For the pope!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:46.060
Not so fast! Band together, and hold the line!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.730
Here you are, Maurice.

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:55.150
If we've gotten in this far,
then this battle is all but over,

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:57.650
Georg!

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:01.310
Be that as it may, I cannot abandon my duty.

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:05.850
You will not bring down the pope.
For the ideals of the Orthodox Church!

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:07.650
Is that really what the reason is?

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:16.060
I'd very much like you to tell me why
you remain faithful to the Orthodox Church.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:19.600
In that case, go ahead and force it out of me.

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:22.520
Is everyone all right?

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.100
Yes. We're grateful to you for your help.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:27.730
All right, let's go join up with the main force.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:28.520
Sir!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:30.440
Alfred!

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.770
Princess Marielle?

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:32.940
Be careful!

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:41.190
The Black Knight, Didier!

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:43.480
Hey, man, are you serious?!

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.690
You are not getting away.

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:52.650
Oh, no, you don't!

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:55.900
You again?

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:59.230
Today is the day when you are bested, Didier!

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:08.310
Are you all right?!

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:13.150
More or less. But what are you doing here?

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:19.400
I had the feeling that something bad
was about to happen to you.

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.940
Hey, you guys!

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:23.060
We have to give Adelheid a hand!

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:25.600
Wait!

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:28.690
Black Knight Didier...

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:33.770
Would you please lay down your sword?

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:35.850
How can you ask this <i>now</i> ?

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:39.560
For what reason are you fighting us?

00:09:39.560 --> 00:09:42.400
I am one of the Ecclesiastical Knights.

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:45.520
I adhere to the ideals and doctrines
of the Orthodox Church,

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:49.480
and I am fighting to defend its pope.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.690
Is that how you really feel?

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:57.350
Princess, this is one of the traitors
who overthrew the kingdom!

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:59.270
There is no reasoning with him!

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:05.850
I, Deflotte Danois, pledge on my life
that I will defend Adelheid!

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:08.400
We will be forcing our way through now, Didier!

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:17.100
A great flow of power...

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:19.060
The people's hatred...

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:20.270
Their fear...

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.650
Their thirst for blood...

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:27.100
All of it will become the source of my power.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:33.100
It is almost time.
The power of the relic will be mine!

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:40.600
This is hardly a fight at all.

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:44.850
No matter how many of you
come at me, you are still no match.

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.020
He's so strong...

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:49.230
He's just too much for us...

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:50.600
Even so...

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:54.400
There's still something that
we have to see through!

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:56.100
Your efforts are in vain.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.400
This is the end.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:08.690
How foolish.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:11.650
You dare to challenge me with your skills?

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:45.810
Yes, that is right. You are a Bearer...

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:52.560
This will do... for now...

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:01.940
Hey, you got him!
I can't believe you beat that Didier bastard!

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:06.400
As badly injured as he is,
not even he could survive this.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:09.310
Princess Marielle, what was that?

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:24.190
Okay, let's hear it, then.

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:27.520
Why did you follow the pope through to the end?

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:36.690
At one time, Vall d'Hebron and I studied
together as clergymen,

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.020
and we both became priests.

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:42.600
People became fascinated by his sanctity,

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.810
and even I expected that one day,

00:12:44.810 --> 00:12:50.440
he would be the man who led
the Hortensian Orthodox Church.

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:54.900
But then, as time went on, I began to see it--

00:12:54.900 --> 00:12:56.900
his true nature.

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:04.310
Vall d'Hebron had been purging those
with whom he did not see eye to eye.

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:09.810
I saw many who were set up and driven out
of the Orthodox Church by him.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:14.810
Then why are you fighting
to protect someone like that?

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:18.310
There are not many who are aware
of how crooked Vall d'Hebron is.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.730
His adherents still revere him.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:26.810
I could not forsake those who were so pure.

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:30.900
There's no reason why you should have
to take the whole burden upon yourself,

00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:33.190
you jackass.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:36.020
I'm sorry, Maurice.

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:51.650
Magnificent. I have obtained divinity itself!

00:13:51.650 --> 00:13:53.940
Now that I have this power...

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.940
You have to stay with me, Mother!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:02.440
Listen closely, Alexis.

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:05.770
You are the son of the king.

00:14:05.770 --> 00:14:07.940
Mother...?

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:13.150
At one time, I lived at the king's side.

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:17.400
Please forgive me for not telling you earlier.

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:22.600
And for not giving you a happy life.

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:25.560
Mother, you didn't do anything wrong.

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:31.230
The blame is on <i>him</i> , who tossed you
aside to suit his convenience.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:34.810
I swear he'll pay for that.

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:38.520
Now is the time when I will take my revenge
against the Hortensian royalty,

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:43.060
and bring about true peace in the kingdom.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:46.350
I have the power to accomplish this, after all.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:00.560
Adelheid, have you petitioned them to surrender?

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.730
No one has given us a response.

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:09.230
The fighting will not stop until we take
the castle and defeat the pope.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:15.270
This unusual attraction that
Pope Vall d'Hebron possesses...

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:17.810
What if there was some other power at work?

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:20.020
Magonian power?

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:21.690
It is a possibility.

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:23.940
Though we may be on opposing sides right now,

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.810
the Ecclesiastical Knights
are subjects of the kingdom.

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:30.560
I don't want there to be any more casualties.

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:32.940
Instruct all our forces
to play the waiting game,

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:35.350
and to not engage the enemy unnecessarily.

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:39.810
In the meantime, we will break into
the castle and bring down the pope.

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:43.310
How are we going to sneak our way in there?

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:45.350
The underground tunnel.

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:46.730
The one we took before?

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:52.400
I know you must have your reasons,
but if Your Highness insists on going in,

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:56.770
there is nothing more for me to say.
I will take over here.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:16:00.100
No matter what happens, keep the princess safe.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.190
Understood?

00:16:02.650 --> 00:16:03.770
Absolutely.

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:09.900
You will be fine now.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.810
Thank you, young lady.

00:16:11.810 --> 00:16:14.270
Take care of yourself, now.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:16.150
Nonnoria...

00:16:16.150 --> 00:16:18.230
Alfred!

00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:21.350
You're helping with the medical corps? Thanks.

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:25.310
I can do it all! I'm doing my best!

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:28.400
You're hurt.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:31.900
Oh, I-I am fine! I am all right!
Do not worry about me!

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:34.310
Just let me take a look at it.

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:44.270
We're about to charge into the castle.
It's a dangerous mission.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.650
I want you to stay here.

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:48.440
I don't want you getting hurt.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.440
All right.

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:53.850
There. Well, off we go.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:58.440
A-Alfred!

00:16:58.440 --> 00:17:02.400
Um... Please make me a promise!

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:05.190
Promise me that you will come back safely.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:10.560
Promise that you will come back to me.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:19.600
I promise.

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.900
Stop. There's no need to kill them.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.230
Aw, but I <i>want</i> to kill them.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.730
Why not?

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:35.400
We're here to search for the relic.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:36.650
Tch.

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:39.350
You two check the underground temple.

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:41.650
Rugis, where are you going?

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:42.940
The castle.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:49.270
Hey, Thalia, if we find the relic,
are we giving it to Rugis?

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:55.150
Of course we aren't.
After all, it's something the Master wants.

00:17:55.150 --> 00:18:00.150
That's true. Oh, but maybe
we could give it to Theresia, too.

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:03.900
Mm-hmm. Let's hurry and find it,
then go and play with Theresia.

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:11.560
I never knew there was this kind
of passageway beneath the castle.

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:15.270
I'm told it's a hidden passage to be used
by the royal family in an emergency.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:22.100
You're sure we have to go through this, right?

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.520
We don't have time to just stand around.

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:25.980
Okay, okay...

00:18:31.020 --> 00:18:32.190
Are you all right?

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:35.270
It felt like something just grabbed me...

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:39.350
Hey, come on, we can't afford
to have you getting spooked <i>now</i> .

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:40.600
What's that?!

00:18:45.900 --> 00:18:47.900
What are those things...

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:52.690
...doing in here?!

00:18:56.770 --> 00:18:58.980
Get it together, Deflotte!

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:03.190
Hey, young Marius!

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:05.190
Deflotte?

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:06.730
You guys go on ahead!

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:08.270
You can't take on this many of them!

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:12.480
I have a score I have to settle
with these monsters!

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:15.270
I'm going to shake off the fear
that's gripping me right now!

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:18.850
Otherwise, I'm going to keep
searching for the faces...

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:20.980
of the people from Petale Village!

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:23.100
That doesn't mean you have
to do anything this crazy!

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:26.600
What do you take your own life for?!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.190
Listen to me.

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.190
The measure of a man is determined

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:33.730
by how many beautiful women
weep over him after he dies.

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.310
Huh?

00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:37.440
Even if I end up cashing out here,

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:41.560
if you... the princess of a whole
kingdom cries for me,

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:45.150
then it means that my life
must have been worth quite a lot.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:49.770
Fight well.

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:52.900
Don't you make the princess grieve for you.

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:56.310
Yeah, I know. By the way, Adelheid...

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:01.350
Are <i>you</i> going to cry for me if I die?

00:20:02.850 --> 00:20:06.730
I'll give you my answer later.

00:20:09.690 --> 00:20:11.520
Now...

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:14.310
...this is my time to shine.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:17.440
I'm not letting a single one of you get past me!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.980
Bring it on!

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:31.310
Strange...

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:33.900
I don't see a single enemy soldier.

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:37.310
It's likely that they were sent
out into the streets to fight.

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:40.850
Let's charge into the throne room
before anyone spots us.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:44.400
What is it?

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:47.310
Something is approaching.
Please go on ahead without me.

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:48.270
Huh?

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:49.510
I'll catch up in a moment.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:50.980
Wait, Adelheid!

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:52.520
Let's go, Princess Marielle.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:53.230
But...

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:55.480
We haven't a moment to spare.

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:57.730
Adelheid will be fine.

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.940
Then let's hurry on ahead.

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:10.850
Who's there? Who's calling to me?

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.650
Show yourself!

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:18.520
The throne room is just up ahead.

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:20.480
Just a moment!

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:27.350
Someone is coming.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:29.400
An ambush?

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:32.480
No, it's just one person. That's...

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.310
It can't be... How...?

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:47.100
No way... No way...

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:48.650
Father?

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:55.980
Dad...?

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:02.090
Chapter 11

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:02.090
Tug-of-War

00:21:58.370 --> 00:22:02.090
~The Far Reaches of Conviction~

00:23:33.480 --> 00:23:35.900
I know I buried you myself!

00:23:35.900 --> 00:23:37.190
Everything is about to come to an end.

00:23:37.190 --> 00:23:40.400
Even so, please allow me to say... thank you, Alfred.

00:23:40.400 --> 00:23:42.900
In the place of the detestable Hortensia family.

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:46.940
That is my code of chivalry!

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Chapter 12

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Promise

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
~Once Again, on the Hill at Sunset~
